###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/parking/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "startTime": "2024-06-01T10:00:00",
    "endTime": "2024-06-01T18:00:00",
    "requester": { "id": 2 },
    "slot": { "id": 1 }
}

### 1. OWNER checks for new requests
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parking/owner/1/pending

### 2. OWNER approves the request (Change the '1' to your Request ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/parking/request/1?status=APPROVED

### 3. REQUESTER checks if they got the spot
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parking/requester/2/updates

### Get payments for a non-existent user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments/resident/9999/unpaid

### Try to pay an already paid bill (use the ID of a paid bill, e.g., 1)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/payments/1/pay

### Manager creates a notice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notices
Content-Type: application/json

{
